owls that's what we do that's why  we're in business  this is all terrific when you see your  happy customers when you see families  coming in  what is it what do you think i feel like  they're coming into my living room we're  having food in my kitchen you know  we made it here enjoy and i i love the  feeling of  home  i've heard the tacos are amazing too  that was sam rubin reporting trejos  tacos recipes and stories from la and  his memoir trejo my life of crime  redemption and hollywood available now  what a fantastic actor well joining us  this weekend as we share stories of  people in places who have helped  southern nevada grow into the diverse  community we know and love today our  hispanic heritage special air saturday  night at 6 30. good to see
 

